On Day 1, we learned CRM **concepts** — Account, Contact, Opportunity as ideas.
On Day 2, we see **how these exist on the platform**:

| Day 1 CRM Concept | Day 2 Platform Reality |
|------------------|----------------------|
| Account | Standard Object — has its own Tab, inside the Sales App |
| Contact | Standard Object — linked to Account via a relationship field |
