## 6. How Developers Extend Salesforce

Salesforce gives developers a layered architecture to work within:

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Your Custom Logic / Apps                │  ← Apex, LWC, APIs  (you work here)
├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│         Salesforce Platform Layer               │  ← Objects, Flows, Rules, Security
├────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│         Salesforce Infrastructure               │  ← Servers, DB, Network  (Salesforce manages)
└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Developers only work in the top layer. The infrastructure is fully managed by Salesforce.

